$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Synthesis of 19a and 19b by oxidation of 18a
and 18b When the compounds 18a, 18b were treated with H2O 2 in THF
solution at rt, the amidates 19a, 19b were formed after 1 h.
5,7-Di-tert-butyl-2-(diethylamino)benzo[d][1,2]oxaphosphone-3(2H)-oxime
(19b, C19H31N2O2P) Yellow crystals; yield: 874 mg (78 %). m.p.: 198 °C
(EtOH); IR (KBr): ν = 3,340 (NOH), 1,252 (P═O), 1,330, 872 (P-NEt2) cm-1;
1H NMR (500.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ = 1.11 (dt, JH-H = 6.4 Hz, 4JP-H = 4.2 Hz,
6H, Me2CN-P), 1.25, 1.37 [2 s, 2 × 9H, 2(Me3C)], 3.19 (q, 3JP-H = 6.8 Hz,
4H, H2C-N-P), 6.41 (d, JH-H = 4.2 Hz, 1H, H(4)-Ar), 6.93 (d, JH-H = 4.2
Hz, 1H, H(6)-Ar), 10.40 (br s, 1H, NOH) ppm; 31P NMR (200.7 MHz,
DMSO-d6): δ = 14.2 ppm; MS (EI, 70 eV): m/z (%) = 366 (18) [M+], 365 (34)
[M+ -1], 335 (40) [M+ -31, NOH], 77 (84).
