Anti-Inflammatory Profiles of Substituted 5- and 6-N-Heterocycle
Bisphosphonate Esters
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Shaddy, Abeer A.; Kamel, Azza A.; Abdou, Wafaa M.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthetic Communications (2013), 43(2), 236-252

